|faction=Sea}}'''Serpents''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Ocean|Oceans]], and currently the only hostile creature spawning in Oceans. They are large, aquatic snake-like reptilian creatures with six glowing eyes, spiked dorsal fins and a gaping mouth filled with razor-sharp teeth. 

Serpents are hunted primarily for their meat, which can be used in mid-late game food. 

== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Serpents|Aggressive creature strategies#Serpent}}

=== Bite ===
Serpents will draw their head back before lunging forward to bite the player (70 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 10 seconds when within 3 meters of a player; even when a player is within attacking range, Serpents will continue moving toward them to stay as close as possible. It extends 3 meters out and hits in an 80-degree horizontal arc.

